            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Give the session a structure — intervals, ladders or incline changes — so there is always a next thing. Break it into five-minute blocks, cover the console, and save a series or podcast you enjoy for treadmill time only. A fan, a view and music at a tempo that suits your stride all help.",
